       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-VOXEL-LOD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-VOXEL-LOD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SCALE-FIDELITY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LOD-INTERPOLATE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LOD-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VOXEL-LOD-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-VOXEL-LOD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-LOD-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-LOD-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SCALE-AND-WAVELET.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-INTERPOLATE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-LOD-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SCALE-AND-WAVELET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALE-FIDELITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-INTERPOLATE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LOD-INTERPOLATE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LOD-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-LOD-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SCALE-FIDELITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LOD-INTERPOLATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LOD-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-VOXEL-LOD-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-LOD-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-LOD-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-LOD-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-LOD-CODE.
